// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3471815600" "<t 2><t 0>Hard to say. She hasn't written me in months, and I'm starting to wonder."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1467401660" "Not good, not good!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3251773706" "Hold on, you got a girl back home?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - OuterGuards 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3208962307" "<t 2><t 0>Not everything, man. Best to be cautious."
// Script Variable ACTOR1_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4072558037" "See? What did I tell you?"
// Script Variable ACTOR3_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4216355525" "Don't know why they post us out here. The ship should be able to detect incoming hostiles."

