// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3885551792" "You've cleared the USS Mitscher of Sky Raiders, and claimed it for yourself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1542367740" "Excellent work, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I've got my personnel preparing the Mitscher for you as we speak.<br><br>I'd like you to review the next phase of the plan I've drawn up. I believe you'll appreciate its elegance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LastriTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P274685711" "We've arrived at Castillo's mobile platform. We're holding a position just out of range of their turrets, and so far they're playing it cautious. The moment you step out of the ship, however, Castillo and his men will know who took the Mitscher, and it's a fair bet they'll be hostile.<br><br>I would suggest clearing out as many Sky Raiders and turret platforms as possible before confronting Castillo, but combat tactics are your area of expertise, not mine."
// Answer Text :
"P561508629" "Thanks, Lastri. I'm off, then."
// Answer Text :
"P3523038341" "Will the Mitscher be able to give me any artillery support?"
// Answer Text :
"P2138335876" "Who are all of these people aboard my ship?"
// Page Support Text :
"P2997032329" "Unfortunately, no. When we took the Mitscher we discovered that not all of its facilities were in a high state of repair. While the ship is functional, the weaponry appears to have been... misused.<br><br>I shall continue to devote resources to the weapons' restoration, but for now you will need to do without."
// Answer Text :
"P3775473910" "Very well. Let's begin."
// Page Personnel Text :
"P1055451996" "<color orange>Lastri smirks at you.</color><br><br>These men work for me, and for the moment I am working for you. You can rest assured that these men will fulfill any duty I assign them, and right now they are here to ensure that your ship is fully functional and operational.<br><br>I <i>did</i> tell you that I would be providing personnel for this project, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}."
// Answer Text :
"P3817917759" "Fair enough. I believe it's time to go."
// Page MissionStart Text :
"P3479113236" "Good luck, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I have faith that you will succeed in this task."
// Answer Text :
"P2263966285" "Of course."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CastilloTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2558537419" "<color orange>Captain Castillo falls to his knees, gasping for breath.</color><br><br>You... you fight admirably, {HeroName}. Even here, on the grounds I call my own, you have bested me.<br><br>I do not spend much time amongst the Villains of the Rogue Isles. Tell me, what do you intend to do now? Is my life now forfeit? Am I to be ransomed?"
// Answer Text :
"P4162219514" "What is that light surrounding you? What happened to you?"
// Answer Text :
"P665195513" "Ransomed? No, Castillo. I came here with an offer."
// Page Light Text :
"P764880728" "On this matter, you know as much as me, I am afraid. While fighting you... I felt a rush of exhilaration, of <i><b>power</i></b>, that coursed through every fiber of my being.<br><br><color orange>Castillo looks up at you, smiling.</color><br><br>It must be you, {HeroName}! Your finesse, your style, your strength! It called to me, and in our dance of death I became alive for the first time!<br><br>Yes, yes! That is it! You have unlocked the true potential of my being!"
// Answer Text :
"P1596970033" "...Really. Well, then how would you like to work for me?"
// Page Offer Text :
"P3223119319" "An offer, eh? You make me feel the fool, {HeroName}. You have come to me with to bargain, and I greeted you with bullets and flame.<br><br>And yet, what a fight we had! I shall remember it for the rest of my life, for however long remains of it. I am almost ashamed to admit, I do not regret our confrontation.<br><br>So, {HeroName}, please tell me. What is this offer you have brought me, from the deck of my own flagship?"
// Answer Text :
"P3554862525" "I want you to work for me."
// Page Work Text :
"P2693470081" "Work... for you?<br><br><color orange>Castillo's brow furrows in thought.</color><br><br>Is that why you are here? You are intent on making the Sky Raiders bow to your whim? I am sorry, {HeroName}, but even if I were to agree, I do not know if my fellow soldiers would follow one such as you."
// Answer Text :
"P2383261300" "Think of it more as an... alliance."
// Page Alliance Text :
"P2316724337" "Very well, {HeroName}. If you wish to parley, then you have earned at least that much. We should discuss this in further detail, perhaps under less confrontational circumstances, no?"
// Answer Text :
"P2933456319" "I think that would be wise, Castillo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3172557080" "As I mentioned earlier, the Sky Raiders aboard the USS Mitscher managed to get a message out to their allies, though they did not have time to identify their attackers. In my opinion, it is safe to assume that the Raiders are aware that the Mitscher has been taken, though its whereabouts - and the identities of the assailants - elude them.<br><br>That will soon be remedied, however. I have located the former captain of the Mitscher, on one of the Sky Raiders' mobile platforms. Since Colonel Duray's arrest, he has taken over as a de facto leader of the Sky Raiders. He respects boldness, and your capture of the Mitscher was nothing if not bold.<br><br>The groundwork has been set: it's time to recruit Captain Ernest Castillo."
// AcceptString :
"P268749425" "Recruit Captain Castillo to your cause"
// SendOffString :
"P2962376079" "We should relocate to the Mitscher immediately. My men have staffed the ship and are prepared to move it into position for your assault on Castillo's platform.<br><br>Castillo is first and foremost a showman, and he will want to engage you in combat before he will listen to anything you say. I am confident that you are more than capable of handling him, but be wary: Castillo has ensured that every inch of the platform is equipped with automated defenses. You'll be fighting him on his own turf."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2436120720" "Recruit Captain Castillo to Your Cause"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3227953873" "The Mitscher awaits your arrival, {HeroName}. Once you are prepared, we can commence the assault."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P330461734" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: O Captain My Captain</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2850435852" "This will be your first step towards establishing your own network of power."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P133746913" "Confer with Lastri"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P4067948880" "Lastri"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3696187284" "Speak with Captain Castillo"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1576366095" "Captain Castillo"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P576968418" "Be prepared for anything, my friends! We have visitors!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2234058959" "<t 2>Ho ho ho, {HeroName}!<t 0>It was you who made the daring attack upon my flagship!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3925334646" "I am sorry, but I must reclaim the Shining Grace for myself! She is a beauty, yes?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3136688879" "You fight well, my friend! Come, let this dance continue!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CastilloFight1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2259360036" "Confront Captain Castillo"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P745549770" "Castillo has retreated. After him!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4175597829" "You see, {HeroName}? This is exhilarating, is it not?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P370071154" "I find myself wondering, what is it that you have come here for? Surely the great Captain Castillo has done nothing to provoke you?"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P257959512" "Ha ha, you are a determined one!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1678299868" "Oh ho ho! Over here, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CastilloFight2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1695758323" "Pursue Castillo!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2995899462" "You have Castillo on the run. Time to corner him."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2607995000" "I do not know... how much longer... I can continue..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1822251065" "You... you believe you are victorious?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1455821243" "No, this is not so! My spirit remains unbroken! I want to continue this dance anew!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4048880512" "You can feel it, yes? The sweet music of battle! You and I, we were destined to meet!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P32568462" "It is time for the finale, {HeroName}! Do not disappoint me!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P605839001" "I... I yield! Mercy, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptFakeCastillo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P516379741" "Corner Castillo and defeat him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CastilloTrigger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3511575104" "You've convinced Captain Castillo to treat with you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1734591640" "Welcome back, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. Excellent work out there. I believe Captain Castillo is prepared to join our cause.<br><br>I hope you don't mind, but I took the liberty of speaking with Castillo aboard the Mitscher, on your behalf. With Duray out of the picture - at least for now - the Sky Raiders have been in a fairly tight spot. Castillo has been attempting to recoup some of the losses they incurred after the conflict in Skyway City. I made him aware of the opportunities involved in expanding the Sky Raiders' presence in the Rogue Isles, and he seemed interested in what we have to offer.<br><br>There is one element of this operation that I did not anticipate, however..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CastilloTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P820900818" "So, how shall we proceed, {HeroName}? Can I expect that we shall begin a glorious and deadly campaign, shining warriors in the darkness? Or do you prefer to lay a cunning trap, and reveal yourself only when your opponent has fallen into it?<br><br>Both ways have their merits, yes? But of course, I defer to you, my inspiration. What would you have me do?"
// Answer Text :
"P162942078" "Stick close to me, Castillo. We don't know what we're up against."
// Answer Text :
"P436731612" "I'm not sure I trust you yet, Castillo. I'll do this alone."
// Page ComeWithMe Text :
"P3423222376" "Excellent, my friend! We shall boldy stride into the darkness, ready for any threat. I am most honored to fight by your side!"
// Answer Text :
"P2119663801" "Come on, then."
// Page DoItAlone Text :
"P505257870" "<color orange>Castillo scowls at you.</color><br><br>You wound me, {HeroName}. I will admit, one day I hope to face you in combat once more, but today is not that day. Today, I am your man, and I am thinking that you may be in need of my support.<br><br>Whatever enemies lurk in this darkness, they have Arachnos running scared, no? You would do well to proceed with caution, and there is nothing more cautious than having an ally by your side.<br><br>Still, if you insist, I will step aside and allow you the glory of this task."
// Answer Text :
"P1470027554" "I see your point. Come along, then."
// Answer Text :
"P2398400815" "I'm afraid I must insist, Castillo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FortunataTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3231672817" "Stay back! STAY BACK!<br><br><color orange>The Fortunata cowers away from you, clearly terrified out of her mind.<br><br></color>Don't come near me! I don't want to see them anymore!"
// Answer Text :
"P2858982237" "Calm down. What is it you don't want to see?"
// Page SeeWhat Text :
"P982666352" "<color orange>The Fortunata seems to let her guard down somewhat, after realizing you're neither a member of the Freakshow or a Talon of Vengeance.</color><br><br>Their <b><i>minds</b></i>. The Freaks are just idiots filled with rage and cruelty, but... but those creatures...<br><br>They have dark thoughts, {HeroName}. Sadism doesn't even begin to describe them... and they <b><i>know</b></i> things. They are aware of the forces that twist this world, the very fates that bind them. They can <b><i>see</b></i> their own destinies, as easily as you can look at your own hands."
// Answer Text :
"P1716553689" "Interesting. Come with me."
// Page SeeWhat2 Text :
"P2993779704" "Wha... what? What do you want me to...<br><br><color orange>The Fortunata recoils from you.</color><br><br>No, NO! I know what you want, I can see it, and I won't! I CAN'T!<br><br>Please... don't make me..."
// Answer Text :
"P1163449436" "(Forcibly drag the Fortunata with you)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P393584089" "Whatever that light surrounding Castillo was, {HeroName}, it appeared to significantly increase his combat potential. Castillo claims that he is unaware of the source of this power, and even seems to claim that he was simply 'inspired' while fighting you.<br><br>I was able to observe your confrontation with Castillo using the ship's onboard sensors, and the ship's telemetric monitors went haywire at the very moment Castillo's 'inspiration' took him.<br><br>I've had some people monitoring the area for similar spikes, and I do believe we've found something."
// AcceptString :
"P1761403270" "Investigate the Energy Anomaly"
// SendOffString :
"P227949217" "This particular incident appears to be centered around an Arachnos base here in Sharkhead. We've intercepted emergency alerts coming from the base, so I can only imagine that whatever's going on in there is bad for Arachnos.<br><br>If you can search the base for any evidence of a phenomenon similar to Castillo's current... condition, then we may be able to pin down what, exactly, is causing these surges in power.<br><br>At the very least, being able to predict these events could be to our advantage, if only to prepare for them. If we could <i>harness</i> this newfound energy, however... you may be able to confront Arachnos more quickly than I anticipated."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2080562275" "The Arachnos base is still sending off a general alert, {HeroName}, but there's no telling how long that will last. If you want to investigate this phenomenon, then you're going to need to do it soon."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P562835898" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Strange Bedfellows</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
