// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1029885440" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>Good work, {HeroName}. I believe that Clamor is the source of the energy fluctuations my people have been tracking.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor maroon>We're going to need some extra insight into what may be causing this phenomenon. See if you can coerce one of Arachnos's resident psychics into aiding us."
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P573700596" "Here we are, {HeroName}. I believe that it is time for us to take action, yes?"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2565111895" "Very well, {HeroName}. I shall leave this endeavor in your capable hands."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P418339197" "I am afraid I have reached my limit, {HeroName}. I wish you luck!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1031261894" "These are not the type of ladies I normally associate myself with...!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3202691748" "Ladies, I could really do without you all having these monstrous qualities!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2121373472" "<t=1 d=1><t=5 d=5>If only you weren't a winged monster! ... Or a Freakshow. ... Or insane."

