// 0 Actor4 :
"P2263199973" "<em grief>"
// 4 Actor5 :
"P725111860" "<t=4 d=4>Ah ha! This one is as inspired as I! It is a pity I could not face her in single combat."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P102784892" "<t=5 d=5>We need this one intact, Captain. I'm not entirely certain you could have restrained yourself."
// 4 Actor2 :
"P260670625" "<t=4 d=4>It's time we took a look. Miss? If you don't mind."
// 2 Actor4 :
"P4235304163" "<Goto E16>...Must I?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P819381101" "<t=5 d=5>Yes, I'm afraid so. You'll be free to go once you've told us what we want to know."
// 4 Actor4 :
"P981115980" "Very well..."
// 3 Actor4 :
"P1721382202" "Augh... no! Stay out!"
// 4 Actor5 :
"P3588503286" "<t=4 d=4>My goodness! What is happening?"
// 5 Actor4 :
"P1617793018" "<scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>The time of chaos is at hand... all will be remade in the shape of power."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P3210283378" "<scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>You who would seek power for your own gain... listen well."
// 4 Actor4 :
"P2898972652" "<scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>Pandora's Box is opening."
// 3 Actor4 :
"P2690641956" "<scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>The power must have a host..."
// 3 Actor4 :
"P4038141368" "<scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>...a vessel..."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P141412586" "<scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>...a <b><i>Champion</b></i>."
// 2 Actor4 :
"P2067237243" "<scale 1.25><color Silver><bgcolor Purple>Please..."
// 2 Actor4 :
"P613239297" "No more..."
