// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2796674791" "You've defeated Clamor, and learned the secret behind this strange energy source..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1028726214" "This... is an unexpected turn of events, {HeroName}. Pandora's Box is an artifact of legend. If it is capable of granting power to people like Clamor or Captain Castillo... well, I don't expect Recluse to take this news lying down. Others will be looking to control this power, and Arachnos will be no exception. Frankly, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}, neither should you.<br><br>If we can find Pandora's Box before your rivals, and can learn to <i>control</i> it, you could have the Rogue Isles in the palm of your hand.<br><br>I'm already diverting some of my resources towards research. If they turn up anything on Pandora's Box, I'll inform you immediately.<br><br><color orange>Lastri smiles at you.</color><br><br>It has been a pleasure working with you thus far, {Hero.gender=male sir|ma'am}. I have a feeling that these next few months will be quite eventful, to say the least."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
